  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Morocco &#x2013; Sportive incubation programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sportive Orange Corners Morocco programme strengthens the sports start-up infrastructure in Morocco by offering an incubation programme for 40 young social entrepreneurs in the sports sector.Sportive Orange Corners Morocco enables them to create new innovative businesses and social enterprises. At least 50% of these social entrepreneurs will be women, thereby supporting equal opportunities for women.The incubatees can collaborate with like-minded individuals to start and grow their sport-related businesses. The incubation programme offers training, business development support, masterclasses, events, coaching and mentoring sessions. It focuses on entrepreneurs in Casablanca and Rabat.Through collaboration between the private and public sectors, Orange Corners combines forces to contribute towards the economic growth of Morocco and strengthen the Moroccan start-up ecosystem.</narrative>
  </description>
